      "post_subject": "Fourier-Transform Holography",
      "content_md": "Hi guys,\n\ni have a question: Why we say Fourier-Transform Holography? At which point of the experiment we have the Fourier-Transformation? And what we transform?\n\nPlease help me! \n\nThanks\n\nChristian",
      "signature": "",
